      "source": "text_layer",
      "label": "text",
      "text": "The systemic exposure of ustekinumab (Cmax and AUC) increased in a linear manner following a single subcutaneous administration at doses ranging from approximately 24 mg to 240 mg in patients with psoriasis.",
